---
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import "@fontsource/outfit/300.css";
import "@fontsource/outfit/700.css";
---

<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <meta
            name="description"
            content="About Time-Life 3 team: Bily Gomez, gamer and web developer"
        />
        <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
        <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
        <title>About - Time-Life 3</title>
    </head>
    <body>
        <Navbar />
        <main>
            <section class="about-container">
                <h1 class="about-title">
                    PROJECT STATUS: <span class="highlight">CONFIDENTIAL</span>
                </h1>
                <div class="about-content">
                    <p>
                        The goal of this project is to track the days that have
                        passed since the release of <span class="hl-bold"
                            >Half-Life 2: Episode Two</span
                        >. In the absence of an official sequel, many of us
                        still keep the faith (myself included). Although hope
                        wavers at times, every new rumor rekindles it. After
                        all, as long as there is life, the wait continues.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        A gamer at heart and a programmer by trade, I created
                        this space as a tribute to the community and in memory
                        of those who left us while waiting for this story’s
                        conclusion.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        The day a sequel is announced, this counter will
                        transform into a countdown, marking the end of this
                        project and a wait that has defined a generation of
                        players. <span class="hl-bold"
                            >...Rise and shine, Mister Freeman.</span
                        >
                    </p>
                    <p class="legal-disclaimer">
                        <i
                            >Legal Disclaimer: This project is independent and
                            is not affiliated with Valve Corporation or the
                            Half-Life franchise. No copyrighted materials have
                            been used.</i
                        >
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>
    </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
    :root {
        --hl-bg: #0a0600;
        --hl-primary: #d47800;
        --hl-secondary: #5e3a1a;
        --hl-accent: #e1e1e1;
        --hl-glow: #ffb400;
        --hl-text-dim: #a0a0a0;
    }

    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }

    html,
    body {
        height: 100%;
        width: 100%;
        font-family: "Outfit", system-ui, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
        background: var(--hl-bg);
        background-image:
            linear-gradient(rgba(10, 6, 0, 0.75), rgba(10, 6, 0, 0.75)),
            url("/lambda-bg.jpeg");
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center;
        background-attachment: fixed;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        color: var(--hl-accent);
        position: relative;
        overflow-y: auto;
        overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body::after {
        content: " ";
        display: block;
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        right: 0;
        background:
            linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 50%),
            linear-gradient(
                90deg,
                rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.02),
                rgba(0, 212, 120, 0.01),
                rgba(0, 120, 212, 0.02)
            );
        z-index: 100;
        background-size:
            100% 4px,
            4px 100%;
        pointer-events: none;
        opacity: 0.4;
    }

    main {
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 120px 2rem 4rem;
    }

    .about-container {
        max-width: 800px;
        width: 100%;
        background: rgba(10, 6, 0, 0.6);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.3);
        padding: 3rem;
        position: relative;
        box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    .about-container::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: -1px;
        left: -1px;
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        border-top: 2px solid var(--hl-primary);
        border-left: 2px solid var(--hl-primary);
    }

    .about-container::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        bottom: -1px;
        right: -1px;
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--hl-primary);
        border-right: 2px solid var(--hl-primary);
    }

    .about-title {
        font-size: 2rem;
        letter-spacing: 4px;
        color: var(--hl-primary);
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.2);
        padding-bottom: 1rem;
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.3);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .about-title {
            font-size: 1.45rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
    }

    .highlight {
        color: #ff4444;
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.5);
    }

    .about-content {
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-weight: 300;
    }

    .about-content p {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--hl-accent);
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .about-content p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .hl-bold {
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .legal-disclaimer {
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.2);
        padding: 1rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 120, 0, 0.2);
    }
</style>
